  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  characterName: Lola
  facePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 837c54d6dfa2d394b93aa54ec949d47c, type: 3}
  npcDialog1: What can I serve you?
  playerResponse1: No drinks tonight, but I do have a question about your colleague.
    How long has Royce been your colleague?
  npcDialog2: Royce? He's been here ever since I got hired. We've grown quite close
    the past couple weeks. Friends and all.
  playerResponse2: Only friends? Nothing else? I've seen you two being almost nose-to-nose.
  npcDialog3: Oh pfff, no. He can be flirtatious sure... But, lovers?  I guess he
    has been staring a lot at me this evening.
  playerResponse3: Right.
