  playerResponse2: Uhu. What kind of connection do you share with russian girl?
  npcDialog3: Uhu. What kind of connection do you share with russian girl?
  playerResponse3: Anna? Just a friendly customer. Are you also on the drug case
    like your friend? You'll probably want to talk to the Crook.
