  characterName: John
  facePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b4d80ea1ac1f6d4db2f4ce053e7c25f, type: 3}
  npcDialog1: 'Detective? What are y- *coughs* Sorry I''m having quite the dry throat
    this evening. '
  playerResponse1: Officer. Have you seen any suspicious activity? Has anyone behaved
    oddly?
  npcDialog2: 'No, I haven''t seen anything suspicious yet. Sick how? '
  playerResponse2: Odd behavior. Otherworldly. The type where you get the heebie
    jeebies.
  npcDialog3: ' I don''t know about otherworldly, sir. But one of the girls started
    twitching a while back, she''s lucky to have such a good friend with her.'
  playerResponse3: She is.
